{"sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"module","roleHeading":"Framework","modules":[{"name":"GnustoScoring"}],"role":"collection","title":"GnustoScoring","externalID":"GnustoScoring"},"abstract":[{"text":"Treasure and event scoring, over an award table the bootstrap can add up.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring","doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/init(awards:)","doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awards"],"title":"The content bundle","anchor":"The-content-bundle"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/treasures(_:into:)","doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/visit(_:register:)"],"title":"Rules the host splices","anchor":"Rules-the-host-splices"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awardOnce(_:)","doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/penalize(_:)"],"title":"Scoring from a rule body","anchor":"Scoring-from-a-rule-body"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/takeValue","doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/depositValue"],"title":"Declaring a treasure’s value","anchor":"Declaring-a-treasures-value"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/declaredMaxScore(items:)"],"title":"Checking the total","anchor":"Checking-the-total"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A game’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxScore"},{"text":" is a literal, read at bootstrap before a single rule has run,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so on its own it is the author’s arithmetic and nothing else. Add a sixth award","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and forget the total, and the game ships with a ceiling the player walks straight","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"past. This library makes the award table the one place a register’s points are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"written, and hands the total to the bootstrap, which compares it against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxScore"},{"text":" and warns when the two disagree.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameContent"},{"type":"text","text":" bundle rather than a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GamePlugin"},{"type":"text","text":", because it owns"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"saved state: two sets of register names — the awards already paid, and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"treasures currently sitting in the trophy case. Both are "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Global"},{"type":"text","text":", so they"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"namespace under "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Scoring"},{"type":"text","text":" and ride along in save files. That makes the wiring two"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"steps rather than one. List the instance in the game’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"content"},{"type":"text","text":" block, then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"splice its rule factories into the game’s own "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rules"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything the rules operate on is the host’s. The host declares the treasures"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and puts a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".takeValue"},{"type":"text","text":" and a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".depositValue"},{"type":"text","text":" on each, declares the trophy case,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and names the rooms whose first entry pays. "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring"},{"type":"text","text":" reads those traits and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"moves the number; the engine’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"score"},{"type":"text","text":" verb, status line and end-of-game epilogue"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"do all the reporting.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Take","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" value is paid once per treasure and never taken back — dropping a gem"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"down a well does not refund it. "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Deposit"}]},{"type":"text","text":" value follows the original Zork’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in-case accounting: credited when the treasure lands in the trophy case, debited"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when it comes back out, so the displayed score rises and falls as the hoard is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rearranged. "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awardOnce(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" on a register missing from the table is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"fatalError","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" rather than a silent zero, because a typo that pays nothing puts the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"game quietly past its own maximum and nothing else would catch it."}]},{"anchor":"Wiring","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Wiring"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import Gnusto","import GnustoScoring","","struct Hoard: Game {","    let title = \"Hoard\"","    let maxScore = 38","","    let scoring = Scoring(awards: [\"cellar\": 25])","","    let cellar = Location { name(\"Cellar\"); description(\"A low, dirt-floored cellar.\") }","    let idol = Item {","        name(\"jade idol\")","        trait(.takeValue, 5)","        trait(.depositValue, 8)","    }","    let trophyCase = Item { name(\"trophy case\"); container; openable; transparent }","","    var content: GameContents { scoring }","","    var rules: Rules {","        scoring.treasures([idol], into: trophyCase)","        scoring.visit(cellar, register: \"cellar\")","    }","","    var map: WorldMap { … }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"25 for the cellar, 5 for taking the idol, 8 for casing it: 38, which is what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxScore"},{"text":" says. Change any one of the three and the bootstrap says so.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An award that fires from somewhere other than a room entry calls"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awardOnce(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" from inside any rule body, and reads its points from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the same table:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["beacon.after(.turnOn) {","    scoring.awardOnce(\"beacon\")","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/penalize(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is the other direction, and is deliberately not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"registered — a death toll is charged every time. The score is a plain "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":" with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no floor, so it can go negative, as it does in the original after an early death."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Treasure values are not listed in the award table. They are already declared on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the items, and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/declaredMaxScore(items:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" sums them off the world. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"game with an empty table and no valued treasures declares nothing and opts out of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the check.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Worked examples","anchor":"Worked-examples"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Sources\/Lighthouse\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the shortest: two event awards, one through","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/visit(_:register:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and one through ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awardOnce(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sources\/Zork1\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the full shape — five event awards plus nineteen treasures","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"whose take and deposit values total exactly the original’s 350."}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustoscoring"]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"references":{"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring/visit(_:register:)":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/visit(_:register:)","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring\/visit(_:register:)","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onEnter"},{"type":"text","text":" rule that pays "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"register"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s declared points the first time"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the player enters "},{"code":"room","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", through "},{"code":"awardOnce","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — the event-scoring idiom"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(Zork’s “into the cellar, +25”). Splice into the host’s rules:"}],"role":"symbol","title":"visit(_:register:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"visit","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Location","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8LocationV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"register"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto4RuleV","text":"Rule"}]},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring/penalize(_:)":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Deducts "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"points"},{"type":"text","text":" from the score — the flip side of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"awardOnce"},{"type":"text","text":", for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"penalties that aren’t award-once (a death toll charged every time)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Unlike an award, this is not registered and can repeat."}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring\/penalize(_:)","title":"penalize(_:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/penalize(_:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"penalize"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}]},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring/awardOnce(_:)":{"kind":"symbol","title":"awardOnce(_:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Awards a register’s declared points exactly once; later calls with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same name are silent no-ops, as is a zero-point award. Callable from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any rule body:"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awardOnce(_:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"awardOnce"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring\/awardonce(_:)"},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring/declaredMaxScore(items:)":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Everything this plugin can pay over a complete playthrough: the declared","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awards","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" table, plus every treasure’s ","type":"text"},{"code":".takeValue","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":".depositValue","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The bootstrap compares the total against the game’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"maxScore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring\/declaredmaxscore(items:)","title":"declaredMaxScore(items:)","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/declaredMaxScore(items:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"declaredMaxScore"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"items"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto4ItemV","text":"Item"},{"kind":"text","text":"]) -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}]},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring/init(awards:)":{"kind":"symbol","title":"init(awards:)","abstract":[{"text":"Creates the scoring content.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/init(awards:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"awards"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"kind":"text","text":"])"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring\/init(awards:)"},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring/treasures(_:into:)":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"For each treasure: the first "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"take"},{"type":"text","text":" pays its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".takeValue"},{"type":"text","text":" (once, for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"good), and its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".depositValue"},{"type":"text","text":" follows the trophy case — credited when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the treasure lands inside, debited when it is taken back out, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"original’s in-case accounting. Register keys derive from the item’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"display name (“take.green gem”), so treasures wired here need unique"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"names. Splice into the host’s rules:"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring\/treasures(_:into:)","title":"treasures(_:into:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/treasures(_:into:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"treasures"},{"kind":"text","text":"(["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Item","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto4ItemV"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"into"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Item","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto4ItemV"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Rules","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5RulesV"}]},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Gnusto/TraitKey/takeValue":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/gnusto\/traitkey\/takevalue","kind":"symbol","title":"takeValue","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Value"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},"role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/takeValue","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"takeValue","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TraitKey","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8TraitKeyV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Points awarded the first time this treasure is taken."}]},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring":{"abstract":[{"text":"Treasure and event scoring, over an award table the bootstrap can add up.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring","title":"GnustoScoring","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Gnusto/TraitKey/depositValue":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Points awarded the first time this treasure lands in the trophy case.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/gnusto\/traitkey\/depositvalue","type":"topic","title":"depositValue","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/depositValue","conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}],"constraints":[{"code":"Value","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}]},"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"depositValue","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TraitKey","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8TraitKeyV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring/awards":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring\/awards","kind":"symbol","title":"awards","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awards","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"awards"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every award-once register this game can pay, and what each pays. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"single source of truth: "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awardOnce(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/visit(_:register:)","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"read their points from here rather than carrying them at the call site,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so the total the bootstrap checks is the total the game pays."}]},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Treasure scoring: typed point values on items, a declared table of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"award-once registers, and take\/deposit wiring for a trophy case. Add it to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a game’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"content","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" block, name every award it can pay, put values on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"treasures, and splice one factory call into the rules:"}],"role":"symbol","title":"Scoring","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scoring"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scoring"}]}}}